{
 "encounter_id": "00645",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I have pain in my chest, since about one hour. Please, I am very scared."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, I'm here. Let's take this step by step. Where is the pain, exactly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Here, in the middle. It is like a pressure, or someone sitting on me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it go anywhere, to the arm, the jaw, your back?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no. It stays in the middle. Not the arm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you breathless?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little breathless, no, not really. Not so much. Just the pressure and my heart is going fast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your heart racing, you mean?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, like drumming. And I am sweating, look, my shirt is wet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can see that. Doctor to patient, I have to ask something honestly, and I'm not here to judge. Have you taken any drugs or anything unusual today?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Cocaine. I took cocaine about one hour before this started. I am sorry, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for telling me, that really helps me look after you. How much, roughly? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Some lines, two, three. I do not do it often. First time this month. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Understood. Any vomiting or feeling sick?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No vomiting. Only a little sick feeling, no, none."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And have you any medical conditions, or take any regular medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have asthma, and I use the salbutamol inhaler, only when needed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had my appendix removed, as a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. I'm going to check your numbers now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 118, blood pressure 152 over 94, oxygen 98 percent.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your heart is going fast and your pressure is up, which fits what cocaine does. I'm going to listen to your chest too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest is clear and your skin is damp and clammy.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Am I having a heart attack? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't tell yet. The chest pain you describe, after cocaine, may well be cocaine-related, but I don't want to assume."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What will you do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to do an ECG right now, to look at your heart's electrical tracing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm also going to order a troponin blood test, which shows heart muscle damage, and we'll repeat it after a few hours."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'll get a chest X-ray to look at your lungs and the size of your heart."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I understand. Can I be helped for the fast heart? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The team will look after you while we find out what's going on. Stay on the monitor, and tell the nurse straight away if the pain gets worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You did the right thing coming in. ~"
  }
 ],
